WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.600
It's from morning to night!

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.400
Oh no! Next!

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.860
1, 2, 3, 4, 5!  A, B, C, D, E, F, G!

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:10.940
1, 2, 3-way scramble!

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:13.360
Yoohoo!

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.490
Yay! Yay!

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.030
Yahoo!

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.740
Let's go!

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:20.330
*gobble gobble*

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:20.870
*tip tap*

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:21.660
*huff puff*

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.960
Alright! I'm all full from breakfast!

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.130
Gather everyone and let's go to school!

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.340
Monday makes me sleepy

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.420
I'll feign sick and it'll be Sunday!

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.720
Yeah! We've got field trips and sports days!

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.840
I'm so excited that I couldn't sleep!

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.010
There's a storm and typhoon warning!

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:39.390
It will be pushed back five days!

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.730
Tests?! No way! I don't want them!

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:48.150
I can't escape! My mind and answer sheet are both blank!

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:52.490
Let's nap in the infirmary!

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.570
Yes! Food time! Three servings of curry rice!

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.740
More! More! I want more!

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.990
My body's growing, so is my appetite!

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:01.120
1, 2, 3 and GO!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.290
I'm all ready!

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:06.170
Let's start our awesome day today!

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.840
I can't stop myself! I won't stop myself!

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.050
Let's all go wild!

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:16.380
Extraterritoriality? What's that?

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.680
I'm an elementary schooler!

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.930
It's autumn and winter!

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.100
They're great! Next!

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:29.770
1, 2, 3-way scramble!

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:40.880
Shin, I got the pictures from the amusement park printed out!

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:43.720
I have my eyes closed.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.880
Check out the pictures of my papa and me.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:55.290
Say cheese!

00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:59.650
Here, thanks!

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:07.270
This will be my treasure.

00:02:08.010 --> 00:02:11.320
You paid that much money for <i>this</i>?

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:14.740
Photos of you are as creepy as ever.

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:17.290
I-I was nervous.

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:18.400
Give it back!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:23.480
If you want it back, then you'll have to give me three extra side dishes at dinner tonight!

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:28.080
Get bigger! Get bigger! Get bigger!

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.970
D-Don't do tha...

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:37.130
I'll remember this!

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:42.470
That was close. She could've eaten it.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:43.840
What's that photo?

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:51.210
Is it something dangerous to look at?

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:52.110
No...

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.060
I'm open to...

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:55.280
paranormals!

00:02:55.280 --> 00:03:00.040
A temple priest said you should burn paranormal photos to cleanse them!

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.860
I was caught by the last person I'd want to see it!

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:07.750
But, there's actually nothing weird in this picture.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.040
Maybe I should just show it to her.

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:17.970
What's with this blood red warrior?!

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:21.640
The temple priest said a red aura represents nothing but pure hatred!

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:29.900
He's from Gachi Rangers, right?

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:34.810
So it's the beautiful girl genius exorcist Hitoha...

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.230
versus the Gachi Rangers!

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:40.410
This means the Gachi Rangers are nothing but a cursed squadron!

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:46.920
They all end with burning!!

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:49.110
What should I do?

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:55.100
I sense an even more evil aura from the pictures over there!

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.670
There could be a terrible spirit in them!

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.060
What did you say?!

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:02.680
T-This is...

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.690
By Satou's shoulder... there's a ghost!

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.090
That's Hito-

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:13.290
No, you're wrong!

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:14.360
That's an evil spirit!

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:16.870
It's an unspeakable terror!

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:21.620
I knew it! Keep away from Satou from now on!

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:25.670
Otherwise, the spiteful spirit will cause you great misfortune!

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:27.180
Misfortune?

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:27.920
Hey!

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:30.110
Isn't that right, Hitoha?!

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:32.650
E-Erm, yeah...

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:37.070
Nice one, occult girl!

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:42.070
I don't know about ghosts, but this could get Futaba away from Satou!

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:44.600
Random troublemakers just popped up from nowhere...

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:46.430
So this means...

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:49.670
You'll be going out with me, Satou!

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:50.360
Huh?

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:58.620
Now those random troublemakers started making random trouble!

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:02.080
There's no such thing as spirits, you retard!

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.030
What?

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:04.830
This is proof!

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:08.460
I don't care, as long as this picture is safe.

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:11.070
Hitoha!

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:13.940
Why are you in this picture with Satou?!

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:16.140
Did you go to the amusement park together?!

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:17.840
Now they're after me!

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:21.460
That's not it! T-That's a terrible spirit...

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:24.690
There's no way I would go with Satou to an amusement park.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:27.980
Then, what about this picture?

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:30.520
It was taken on the same date.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:35.410
There was a Gachi Rangers show at the amusement park, right?

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:37.490
My little brother told me.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:40.630
T-That's just another evil spirit!

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:42.740
Look! Can't you tell they look similar?!

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:43.990
This is bad!

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.080
I must burn them right now!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.930
Those two are really getting along!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.460
I'm not worried about ghosts.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.970
O-Okay...

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:07.930
You have to build the situation to get the panty shots!

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:10.810
You can always go there again.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.540
You just took a picture, didn't you?

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:15.480
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:17.600
I heard it crystal clear!

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.830
Yep, same as always!

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:24.240
'kay everyone, take your seats!

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:29.920
Aren't you going to the rooftop today?

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:34.740
I think it's about time I stopped playing there.

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:41.640
Mitsuba will call me kiddy, so I'm trying really hard not to go!

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:43.380
Where is she anyway?

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:51.650
Mitsuba, you're such a kid!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:57.800
Even I don't ride those kinds of things anymore, you know.

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:00.080
This isn't a kiddy ride!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.070
It's still embarrassing.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:08.110
Eh, isn't that Mitsuba?

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.930
Ah, you're right!

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:15.150
God, you're the last person I wanted to meet!

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:17.820
At least say it quietly!

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:25.850
Mitsuba, is it true you gained weight again?

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:29.550
What are you talking about?

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.370
Please stop spreading rumors about me!

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:34.560
But Futaba said the other day...

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:39.280
Mitsuba got so big that the button on her skirt popped off!

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:43.200
The button shot straight through the window and flew really far!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:46.340
Mitsuba is the world's biggest pig!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:48.320
Pig!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:51.180
Pig!

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:54.290
FFFuutaabaa...

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:58.130
So that's why you were trying to lose weight riding that exercise machine!

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:00.570
How pathetic!

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:03.150
Who said anything about going on a diet?

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:05.640
I confused it with a kiddy ride, that's why I rode it!

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:08.160
Let's go!

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.390
Ah, that was fun!

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:13.390
But that's even worse.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:15.900
Thanks for the food.

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:17.790
You're finished?

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.240
I don't like the taste.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:33.660
If I only had that, I'd definitely lose weight quickly and easily!

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.880
You're better off dead!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:44.170
Since I can't afford it, I'll just have to take it slow and steady.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.210
Come hold my legs!

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:00.160
My eyes!

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:04.950
This is all your fault!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.850
W-What is?

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:08.510
Everything!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:10.950
So noisy.

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:13.670
T-This is...

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:18.210
This is it!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:20.420
What's the matter?

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.340
Don't mind me. Just start walking!

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:23.870
Sure.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:28.500
So good!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:32.810
It feels just like it... I can feel it in my abs already!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:37.060
Stop making a ruckus inside the house!

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.480
Do it outside.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.060
Got it!

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:42.570
W-Wait...

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:46.360
Stop... STOP!

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:49.530
I love the night air!

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:58.170
Oh god, no!

00:09:58.170 --> 00:10:00.580
If they see me like this...

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:05.410
Is that how the Marui family walks their pet?

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.890
My reputation will...!

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:11.500
Stop... stop... please!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:12.600
This is bad... this is bad...

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.850
What the heck? That figure looks familiar.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:20.740
What could have possibly happ-

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.280
What is it?

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:27.530
You should all be thankful to me!

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:31.530
I don't get it.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:53.500
Hey, so about tonight's Christmas party at Sugi's place...

00:10:56.000 --> 00:11:01.050
Right! It's Christmas eve, the single most painful night of the year!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:23.410
Oh, what's the matter, Mr. Yabe?

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:25.530
Erm...

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:30.540
Miss K-Kuriyama... T-T-Tonight...

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:31.920
Tonight?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.840
Sensei, I feel better now, so I'll be heading back!

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.180
There's blood all over you!

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.180
Eh?

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:54.770
Healing love!

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:02.110
There are more injured over there!

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.360
There!

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.450
Here!

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.200
There!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:12.250
In the end, I couldn't invite her.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:14.000
Let's invite the boys too.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.380
Shin!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:19.880
We have six girls, so let's invite six guys!

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:22.420
Wait a sec, that'd be like a group date!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:27.260
I-It's not like that! Since it's Christmas, we should be nice to them, too, right?

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:28.510
Lechery.

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:32.310
We can play the King game and stuff, like a normal party!

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.770
So it <i>is</i> a group date.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:37.860
They're having a Christmas party. It sure sounds fun.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:40.690
Well, I'm fine with it being a group date.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.070
You're interested?!

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.780
E-Excuse me...

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:47.570
I-I'd like to go too.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:51.580
A teacher, in our group date...

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.330
Wait, a group date? What are you talking about?

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.460
Yabecchi, you fail as a teacher!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:58.460
Eh!?

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.800
Let's go, let's go.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:03.340
No way...

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.520
Okay, then let's do it!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.230
Who's the king?!

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.270
Me, me!

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:18.860
Well, it's not like I'm not royalty already.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:22.690
So, number six and number two...

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.450
A boy and girl!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.530
What will you make them do?!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:30.120
Eating a pocky together? Kissing through plastic wrap?!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.450
Give me your cake!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:42.710
Mitsuba, you're doing it wrong!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.470
Ifint it juft fhr? It ma orber abter all.

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:47.260
Who's the King?!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:48.680
I am.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.010
Hitoha!

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.510
So number four and number five...

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:53.810
It's me.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.020
Me again?

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.520
You're annoying. Go home.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:02.520
Jeez! Everyone, take this more seriously!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.710
Merry Christmas!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.090
Who's the King?!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:31.260
Oh, it's me!

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:35.470
Erm, okay... so number one and number four...

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:37.100
Me?

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:40.940
The pocky game! The pocky game! The pocky game!

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:41.980
Oh?

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:44.730
Miyo!

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:47.490
Number one and number four...

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:51.320
are my buddies!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.120
Let's keep on moving.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.910
What about the King's order?

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:57.950
Do you really have to order people to be buddies?

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:00.670
Miya, that's not what I was thinking!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.420
Huuuuh?!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.340
Let's do it Gachi style!! Yeah!!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:17.270
Gachi Rangers, roll out!

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:26.190
They rise up to protect the planet.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:32.070
Doing their best day and night.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:34.070
Their blazing-

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.830
Who's the King?!

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.580
Me.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.920
Let's just have a do-over.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.960
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:46.040
For once, I agree with you.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:53.090
Could it be that Chiba will actually give an order fitting of King game?

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:55.550
King, what's your order?!

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.760
Let's see.

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:00.140
Then number four and number six...

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.150
Four and six...

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:05.400
Four and six...

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.650
Four and six...

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.860
Four and six...

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.910
find my nipples!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.120
Huh?

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.910
Now, where are they?

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:22.580
Just point them out with your finger!

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.670
Do it!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.500
C'mon!

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.670
That's my face...

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:35.340
I did my best not to do perverted stuff to you girls...

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.300
It would've ended the same.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:41.980
Jeez! This is nothing like how a King game should be!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:45.650
Huh? Weren't there supposed to be six guys and six girls?

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.520
You should've noticed that earlier.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:54.570
Ah! Futaba and Satou, stop playing games and come help make couples!

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:57.570
No, it's too late.

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:58.580
Damn it!

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.330
You're gonna lose, Shin!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.870
Where are the other guys?

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.670
Ma'am, please have something more to drink.

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.260
Ma'am, would you like some cake?

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.670
Ma'am, I've brought you some fruit.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:16.640
Oh my, thank you!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:22.640
The boys from 6-3 don't seem all that weird.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:23.850
How disappointing.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:36.990
Oh my!

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:39.660
I found a new boy!

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:48.630
Yoshioka, you picked the wrong house.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:53.920
Well, we didn't form any couples in the end.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.380
It's because you were eating all the time.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.220
Good night!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.300
Brush your teeth!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:04.270
I have to go to sleep before Santa comes!

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:09.980
Hello, Marui here.

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.150
Ah, papa...

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:14.530
Understood...

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.950
Papa will probably be late.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:22.030
What?! Then who's going to play Santa?!

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:25.200
You almost got caught when you did it last time!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.210
I'm not doing it, either.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:32.000
I bet he's doing nothing.

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.550
Merry Christmas!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:40.590
What's up with those clothes? Did you walk all the way like that?

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:42.180
That's right!

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:45.140
He also has a woman's Santa dress.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:47.560
How did you know?

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:50.770
You have it for when the right moment comes, right?

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:55.150
Yabe, come get me!

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:58.610
Wait up!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.700
Creepy.

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:11.580
I don't know what, but it looks like something happened.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.720
There we go!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:36.110
I didn't wake her up.

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.900
Let me go.

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.360
Wait... l-let me...

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:45.370
She's so strong!

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:47.950
He's late!

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:54.630
Ahh! You pervert!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.130
Be quiet!

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:00.380
She wouldn't let go of my clothes.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.430
And I shouldn't wake her up, so...

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:05.220
Do you have anything I could change into for now?

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.930
I'm home.

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:11.690
You're pretty early.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:15.520
Hey, what did you do about Futaba's present?

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.690
W-We put it on her bed.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.320
Good job!

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:25.280
If I'm found, he'll totally think I'm a pervert!

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.450
It wasn't on purpose, you know.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.420
It wasn't...

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:40.460
Hitoha...

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:43.430
I didn't know your legs got this rough.

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:44.630
They're hairy...

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:47.100
Y-Yeah.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.140
It's a problem.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:54.600
Oh, that's right! I got presents for you two.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:55.480
Really?

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:59.020
This is for you, Mitsuba.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:00.730
Oh wow!

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:02.690
You're so thoughtful!

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.610
Munch munch munch

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:09.580
Just how much does this pig eat?

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.580
And this one's for you, Hitoha.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:13.540
Shoes.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.960
Let's try them.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:20.670
Whoa, they don't fit at all.

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.630
A-At night, my feet get swollen...

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:28.300
Oh well. I'll return them tomorrow and get you some cream for your feet instead.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.400
I'm really sorry!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.490
That was my leg!

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:44.650
So, those shoes...

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:46.400
Please don't return them!

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:01.130
I could've even beaten you half dead if you hadn't come out.

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:03.420
I think you already <i>have</i> beat me half dead.

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:08.010
I didn't know someone who goes around in just his boxers could be a homeroom teacher.

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:11.510
Wait, so you knew who I was?

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:14.520
If it's 'bout my girls, I know everything!

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:18.060
You don't.

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:19.770
Huh?

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:43.800
The three-minute rule says this candy's still safe to eat!

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:50.760
Really, aren't you tired of making a fuss about this every time?

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:50.760
Yeah!

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:56.230
Just stop showing me that pretense of kindness

00:22:56.230 --> 00:22:59.480
Will it do good in the long term? You ask

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:01.810
It's none of your business!

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:05.280
Inspection time for all~

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:07.780
Haven't seen that before? Does it even exist?

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:09.110
Let's check it out!

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:12.240
Everyone's perfectly uniform!

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:12.240
Yeah! Yeah!

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:17.290
That's why we're straying from the path... Hurry!

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:15.290
Go! Go!

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:21.540
It's a good day for new encounters

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:29.720
Next week's sparkling if you feel the weak pulse!

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:36.770
Let's have a good sleep!

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:42.020
Once you're fully rested and recharged

00:23:42.610 --> 00:23:45.940
Let's go backpacking!

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:59.250
Sports day is coming up next! I can't wait!

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:01.460
Didn't we do this last season?

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:02.870
We also did the Christmas episode.

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:05.250
We can do it again and again as long as it's fun!

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:10.100
At the Height of Your Perversion

00:24:05.250 --> 00:24:07.420
Like how Mitsuba's been on diet forever.

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:09.130
Damn it!
